    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "DNG Farrelly Southern are delighted to present No. 26 The Close, Ledwill Park, Kilcock to the market. Built in 2020, this beautifully presented three-bedroom semi-detached home extends to approximately 114.11 sq. m (1,228 sq. ft) and offers bright, spacious and exceptionally well-planned living accommodation.\n\nPresented in excellent condition throughout, No. 26 enjoys a particularly attractive position at the end of a quiet road within this highly regarded development. The property combines a thoughtful internal layout with excellent energy efficiency and a private, south-east-facing rear garden, making it an ideal home fore anyone seeking a modern, turnkey property.\n\nThe accommodation has an easy and practical flow. Both the living room and kitchen/dining room benefit from dual-aspect natural light, creating wonderfully bright and welcoming spaces. The generous living room provides a comfortable setting in which to relax, while the spacious kitchen/dining room is ideally suited to everyday family life and entertaining, with direct access to the rear garden. A separate utility room and guest WC complete the ground-floor accommodation.\n\nUpstairs are three well-proportioned bedrooms, including a spacious main bedroom with ensuite shower room. The remaining bedrooms are also of a very good size and are served by a bright, contemporary family bathroom. A Stira staircase provides convenient access to the attic, which is partly boarded to offer useful additional storage.\n\nOutside, the driveway provides off-street parking for two cars, with additional on-street parking available to the front and side of the property. Gated side access leads to the private rear garden, which enjoys a desirable south-easterly orientation and is not directly overlooked. The garden is laid out with a lawn, paved patio and attractive raised planting beds, providing a lovely space for outdoor dining, gardening and family enjoyment.\n\nBuilt with energy efficiency in mind, the property benefits from a thermostatically controlled air-to-water heat-pump heating system, high levels of insulation, excellent airtightness and double-glazed windows.\n\nLedwill Park is a modern and well-established residential development within easy walking distance of Kilcock town centre. Kilcock offers an excellent selection of shops, cafés, restaurants, schools and sporting amenities, together with the Royal Canal Greenway. Kilcock Train Station provides regular services towards Dublin, while the M4 motorway is only a short drive away, making the location particularly convenient for commuters. Maynooth and its extensive range of shopping, educational and recreational facilities are also within easy reach.\n\nNo. 26 The Close offers an excellent combination of generous accommodation, modern energy efficiency, a private sunny garden and a quiet end-of-road setting. Viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Three-bedroom semi-detached home, Built in 2020.\nApproximately 114.11 sq. m (1,228 sq. ft)\nPresented in excellent condition throughout\nSpacious, well-designed living accommodation with three well-proportioned bedrooms\n• Dual-aspect kitchen/dining room and living room\n• Three bathrooms, including main-bedroom ensuite\n• Energy-efficient air-to-water heat-pump system\n• Stira access to a partly boarded attic\n• Private south-east-facing rear garden\n• Rear garden not directly overlooked\n• Lawn, paved patio and raised planting beds\n• Gated side access\n• Cobblelock driveway with parking for two cars\n• Additional on-street parking to the front and side\n• Quiet end-of-road position\n• Walking distance of Kilcock town and train station\n• Convenient access to the M4 motorway and Maynooth\n\n"
